                                        "entry_id": "9e7e574a-d806-37f8-9edf-203c07f78843",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A portion of a total amount (of some substance or a sample/specimen thereof) that does not divide evenly into it, thus leaving a (nonzero) remainder."
